<title>NETHERLANDS: HEIDEMIJ IN BELGIAN JOINT VENTURE.</title>
<headline>HEIDEMIJ IN BELGIAN JOINT VENTURE.</headline>
<dateline>ARNHEM, Netherlands 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Engineering consultancy Heidemij NV said on Monday it had set up a 50-50 joint venture with Belgian company Van Roey NV.</p>
<p>The jointly-owned company will be called Belgium's Remedial Contractor or BREMCON and will be active in environmental projects.</p>
<p>Heidemij said the new unit would be able to benefit from new Belgian legislation on cleaning of polluted soil, which has similarities with Dutch law.</p>
<p>No financial details of the cooperation pact were given.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
